Modelica source:
```modelica
connector Flange
  Real phi;
  flow Real tau;
end Flange;
model Rotor
  Flange p;
end Rotor;
model Study
  Flange support;
  Rotor n1;
  Rotor n2;
  Rotor n3;
equation
  connect(support,n1.p);
  connect(n1.p,n2.p);
  connect(n2.p,n3.p);
end Study;
```

Question:
Within the equation scope of model instance Study, return the canonical signed member vector for the primitive flow connection set formed by explicit connect statements in that scope that contains support.tau.

Target:
support.tau

Answer format:
Use ascending path:integer entries joined by commas without spaces; coefficients must be primitive, nonzero, and oriented so the first coefficient is positive.
